God</hi>. <hi rendition="#k">schaumburg</hi> <hi rendition="#g">in Compendio iuris Dige-<lb/>
&#x017F;tor</hi>. Lib. XLIV. Tit. 7. §. 3. Sigillatim vero, ut <hi rendition="#i">obli-</hi></hi><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">gatio</hi></hi></fw></note>.</p>             <lb/>
